Additional third-party libraries for compression and HEIC decode (KYG Style Tools).

1) heic2any 0.0.4 — MIT (Alex Corvi). Browser HEIC/HEIF conversion.
   Bundled WASM typically includes libheif / libde265 code under LGPL-3.0.
   Corresponding source: https://github.com/alexcorvi/heic2any and upstream libheif.
   See LICENSE-HEIC2ANY.txt. Obtained via npm pack heic2any@0.0.4.

2) @jsquash/oxipng 2.3.0 — Apache-2.0 (Squoosh oxipng WASM).
   See LICENSE-OXIPNG.txt / LICENSE-OXIPNG-CODEC.txt.
   Obtained via npm pack @jsquash/oxipng@2.3.0.

3) gifsicle-wasm-browser 1.5.19 — MIT wrapper (renzhezhilu).
   Embedded gifsicle engine is GPL-2.0. See LICENSE-GIFSICLE-WRAPPER-MIT.txt and
   LICENSE-GIFSICLE-GPL-2.0.txt. Corresponding source:
   https://github.com/renzhezhilu/gifsicle-wasm-browser and https://github.com/kohler/gifsicle
   Obtained via npm pack gifsicle-wasm-browser@1.5.19.

4) SVG tidy is implemented in-app (comment stripping); no svgo binary is shipped.

Do not copy assets from third-party websites; use official npm packages.
